    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="5" textcolor="#43505C">Figure 1. Cap elevation: piles, bearings, transverse runs, added span bars and the governing stations S (shear) and N, P, B (longitudinal tension) used in Section 8.</paragraph>
