    </embed>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="5" textcolor="#43505C">Service III is not applicable to this cap; fatigue is not evaluated in this calculation.</paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="14" spacingafter="6" fontweight="bold" textcolor="#1766A0" spacingbefore="8" keepwithnext="True">7. Shear depth</paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="1" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="True">
      <dynexp formula="d_min = Min(d_N, d_P, d_B) to in" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="True" showsteps="False">
        <expbody>d_min = Min(d_N, d_P, d_B) to in</expbody>
        <expresult> = 31.806 in</expresult>
      </dynexp>
    </paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="5" textcolor="#43505C">least effective depth</paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="1" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="True">
      <dynexp formula="d_va = Min(d_N - a_N/2, d_P - a_P/2, d_B - a_B/2) to in" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="True" showsteps="False">
        <expbody>d_va = Min(d_N - a_N/2, d_P - a_P/2, d_B - a_B/2) to in</expbody>
        <expresult> = 31.135 in</expresult>
      </dynexp>
    </paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="5" textcolor="#43505C">least d - a/2</paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="1" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="True">
      <dynexp formula="d_v = Max(0.9*d_min, 0.72*h, d_va) to in" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="True" showsteps="False">
        <expbody>d_v = Max(0.9*d_min, 0.72*h, d_va) to in</expbody>
        <expresult> = 31.135 in</expresult>
      </dynexp>
    </paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="5" textcolor="#43505C">effective shear depth (cap analysis)</paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="14" spacingafter="6" fontweight="bold" textcolor="#1766A0" spacingbefore="8" keepwithnext="True" pagebreakbefore="break">8. Actual-cage section checks at the governing stations</paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="6">Stations k: 0 = S, the shear-governing point; 1, 2, 3 = N, P, B, the longitudinal-tension points of each region; 4 = M, the least minimum transverse steel. Each line gives the interval, combination C, element E, load state, station and tension face; the equations recompute every check there.</paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="4">• S shear: R4-1 → R4-2 · C1 E15 · STRENGTH-I · x = 74.745 in · bottom face</paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="4">• N long.: R4-3/R4-4 · C1 E16 · STRENGTH-I · x = 84.745 in · top face</paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="4">• P long.: R6-4/R6-5 · C1 E29 · STRENGTH-I · x = 155.000 in · bottom face</paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="4">• B long.: R7-1/R7-2 · C1 E31 · STRENGTH-I · x = 161.500 in · bottom face</paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="4">• M min Av: R7-5/R7-6 · C1 E35 · STRENGTH-I · x = 188.190 in · bottom face</paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="12" spacingafter="6" fontweight="bold" textcolor="#1766A0" spacingbefore="6" keepwithnext="True">8.1 Station inputs (from the cap analysis)</paragraph>
    <embed spacingbefore="5" spacingafter="8">
      <table name="StationInputs" capture="False" colwidths="1:70, 2:98, 3:98, 4:98, 5:98, 6:98, 7:120">
        <stylerule range="A1:G18" fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="9" valueformat="RoundedNumber(3, 3, {PriorityUnits: []})" border="Border(&quot;AllSides&quot;, &quot;Solid&quot;, 0.6, &quot;#A78638&quot;); Border(&quot;BetweenRows&quot;, &quot;Solid&quot;, 0.4, &quot;#A78638&quot;);"/>
        <stylerule range="A1:G1" horzalign="Center" vertalign="Center"/>
        <stylerule range="B2:G18" horzalign="Center" vertalign="Center"/>
        <row>
          <textcell name="StationInputsR0C0" capture="False" background="#F7E6B9">
            <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="9" spacingafter="0" fontweight="bold" horzalign="Center">Input</paragraph>
          </textcell>
          <textcell name="StationInputsR0C1" capture="False" background="#F7E6B9">
            <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="9" spacingafter="0" fontweight="bold" horzalign="Center">S</paragraph>
          </textcell>
          <textcell name="StationInputsR0C2" capture="False" background="#F7E6B9">
            <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="9" spacingafter="0" fontweight="bold" horzalign="Center">N</paragraph>
          </textcell>
          <textcell name="StationInputsR0C3" capture="False" background="#F7E6B9">
            <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="9" spacingafter="0" fontweight="bold" horzalign="Center">P</paragraph>
          </textcell>
          <textcell name="StationInputsR0C4" capture="False" background="#F7E6B9">
            <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="9" spacingafter="0" fontweight="bold" horzalign="Center">B</paragraph>
          </textcell>
          <textcell name="StationInputsR0C5" capture="False" background="#F7E6B9">
            <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="9" spacingafter="0" fontweight="bold" horzalign="Center">M</paragraph>
          </textcell>
          <textcell name="StationInputsR0C6" capture="False" background="#F7E6B9">
            <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="9" spacingafter="0" fontweight="bold" horzalign="Center">Meaning</paragraph>
          </textcell>
        </row>
        <row>
          <textcell name="StationInputsR1C0" capture="False" background="#FFF8E9">
            <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="9" spacingafter="0">x (in)</paragraph>
          </textcell>
          <textcell name="StationInputsR1C1" capture="False" background="#FFF8E9">
            <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="9" spacingafter="2">
              <dynexp formula="x_S = 74.74521311 in" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="False" showsteps="False" style="Required Input">
                <expbody>x_S = 74.74521311 in</expbody>
              </dynexp>
            </paragraph>
          </textcell>
          <textcell name="StationInputsR1C2" capture="False" background="#FFF8E9">
            <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="9" spacingafter="2">
              <dynexp formula="x_N = 84.74521311 in" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="False" showsteps="False" style="Required Input">
                <expbody>x_N = 84.74521311 in</expbody>
              </dynexp>
            </paragraph>
          </textcell>
          <textcell name="StationInputsR1C3" capture="False" background="#FFF8E9">
            <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="9" spacingafter="2">
              <dynexp formula="x_P = 155 in" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="False" showsteps="False" style="Required Input">
                <expbody>x_P = 155 in</expbody>
              </dynexp>
            </paragraph>
          </textcell>
          <textcell name="StationInputsR1C4" capture="False" background="#FFF8E9">
            <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="9" spacingafter="2">
              <dynexp formula="x_B = 161.499998 in" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="False" showsteps="False" style="Required Input">
                <expbody>x_B = 161.499998 in</expbody>
              </dynexp>
