    </embed>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="5" textcolor="#43505C">Not checked: Bottom transverse face: excluded from face shrinkage / temperature area and spacing checks: open-bottom pile stirrups in R2, R4, R6, R8.</paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="1" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="True">
      <dynexp formula="Skin_req = If(Max(d_N, d_P, d_B) &gt;= 3 ft, 1, 0)" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="True" showsteps="False">
        <expbody>Skin_req = If(Max(d_N, d_P, d_B) &gt;= 3 ft, 1, 0)</expbody>
        <expresult> = 0.000</expresult>
      </dynexp>
    </paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="5" textcolor="#43505C">skin steel required (1): d ≥ 3 ft, 5.6.7</paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="1" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="True">
      <dynexp formula="s_sk = Min(d_min/6, 12 in) to in" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="True" showsteps="False">
        <expbody>s_sk = Min(d_min/6, 12 in) to in</expbody>
        <expresult> = 5.301 in</expresult>
      </dynexp>
    </paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="5" textcolor="#43505C">maximum skin-bar spacing, if required</paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="5" textcolor="#43505C">Skin steel not required (largest effective depth 32.00 in &lt; 36 in).</paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="14" spacingafter="6" fontweight="bold" textcolor="#1766A0" spacingbefore="8" keepwithnext="True">11. Hook development of the governing added span bar</paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="6">Bar L10-S1 (#5, Added span row 1): largest hook length over half its span, 5.10.8.2.4a.</paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="3" fontweight="bold" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="True">Bar data (from the cap analysis)</paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="4" level="1"><dynexp formula="d_bh = 0.625 in" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="False" showsteps="False" style="Required Input"><expbody>d_bh = 0.625 in</expbody></dynexp><break type="tab"/>bar diameter</paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="4" level="1"><dynexp formula="A_bh = 0.31 in^2" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="False" showsteps="False" style="Required Input"><expbody>A_bh = 0.31 in^2</expbody></dynexp><break type="tab"/>bar area</paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="4" level="1"><dynexp formula="r_h = 2.1875 in" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="False" showsteps="False" style="Required Input"><expbody>r_h = 2.1875 in</expbody></dynexp><break type="tab"/>hook bend radius</paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="4" level="1"><dynexp formula="c_bh = 1.786431825387407 in" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="False" showsteps="False" style="Required Input"><expbody>c_bh = 1.786431825387407 in</expbody></dynexp><break type="tab"/>cover or half spacing, c_b</paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="4" level="1"><dynexp formula="λ_rl = 1" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="False" showsteps="False" style="Required Input"><expbody>λ_rl = 1</expbody></dynexp><break type="tab"/>location factor</paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="4" level="1"><dynexp formula="λ_cf = 1" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="False" showsteps="False" style="Required Input"><expbody>λ_cf = 1</expbody></dynexp><break type="tab"/>coating factor</paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="4" level="1"><dynexp formula="L_bh = 32 in" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="False" showsteps="False" style="Required Input"><expbody>L_bh = 32 in</expbody></dynexp><break type="tab"/>bar length between its hooks</paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="1" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="True">
      <dynexp formula="f_h = Min(A_bh*fy, d_bh*r_h*0.45*fc) to kip" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="True" showsteps="False">
        <expbody>f_h = Min(A_bh*fy, d_bh*r_h*0.45*fc) to kip</expbody>
        <expresult> = 3.384 kip</expresult>
      </dynexp>
    </paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="5" textcolor="#43505C">bar force at the hook node</paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="1" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="True">
      <dynexp formula="l_db = 0.17*d_bh*((fy - f_h/A_bh)/(1 ksi)/(1.97*λ*(fc/(1 ksi))^0.25))^2 to in" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="True" showsteps="False">
        <expbody>l_db = 0.17*d_bh*((fy - f_h/A_bh)/(1 ksi)/(1.97*λ*(fc/(1 ksi))^0.25))^2 to in</expbody>
        <expresult> = 28.126 in</expresult>
      </dynexp>
    </paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="5" textcolor="#43505C">basic length, 5.10.8.2.4a-1</paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="1" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="True">
      <dynexp formula="λ_c = Max(0.3, Min(1, d_bh/c_bh))" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="True" showsteps="False">
        <expbody>λ_c = Max(0.3, Min(1, d_bh/c_bh))</expbody>
        <expresult> = 0.350</expresult>
      </dynexp>
    </paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="5" textcolor="#43505C">confinement factor</paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="1" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="True">
      <dynexp formula="l_ds = l_db*Min(1.7, λ_rl*λ_cf)*λ_c to in" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="True" showsteps="False">
        <expbody>l_ds = l_db*Min(1.7, λ_rl*λ_cf)*λ_c to in</expbody>
        <expresult> = 9.840 in</expresult>
      </dynexp>
    </paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="5" textcolor="#43505C">straight part</paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="1" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="True">
      <dynexp formula="l_dh = Max(8*d_bh, 6 in, l_ds + r_h + d_bh/2) to in" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="True" showsteps="False">
        <expbody>l_dh = Max(8*d_bh, 6 in, l_ds + r_h + d_bh/2) to in</expbody>
        <expresult> = 12.340 in</expresult>
      </dynexp>
    </paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="5" textcolor="#43505C">required hook development</paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="1" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="True">
      <dynexp formula="DC_hk = l_dh/(L_bh/2)" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="True" showsteps="False">
        <expbody>DC_hk = l_dh/(L_bh/2)</expbody>
        <expresult> = 0.771</expresult>
      </dynexp>
    </paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="5" textcolor="#43505C">required / half the bar length</paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="14" spacingafter="6" fontweight="bold" textcolor="#1766A0" spacingbefore="8" keepwithnext="True" pagebreakbefore="break">12. Summary of checks</paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="1" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="True">
      <dynexp formula="DC_shear = DC_V_S" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="True" showsteps="False">
        <expbody>DC_shear = DC_V_S</expbody>
        <expresult> = 0.592</expresult>
      </dynexp>
    </paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="5" textcolor="#43505C">shear at S</paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="1" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="True">
      <dynexp formula="DC_LN = DC_L_N" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="True" showsteps="False">
        <expbody>DC_LN = DC_L_N</expbody>
        <expresult> = 0.955</expresult>
      </dynexp>
    </paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="5" textcolor="#43505C">longitudinal tension at N</paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="1" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="True">
      <dynexp formula="DC_LP = DC_L_P" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="True" showsteps="False">
        <expbody>DC_LP = DC_L_P</expbody>
        <expresult> = 0.771</expresult>
      </dynexp>
    </paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="5" textcolor="#43505C">longitudinal tension at P</paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="1" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="True">
      <dynexp formula="DC_LB = DC_L_B" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="True" showsteps="False">
        <expbody>DC_LB = DC_L_B</expbody>
        <expresult> = 0.859</expresult>
      </dynexp>
    </paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="5" textcolor="#43505C">longitudinal tension at B</paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="1" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="True">
      <dynexp formula="DC_minAv = DC_Av_M" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="True" showsteps="False">
        <expbody>DC_minAv = DC_Av_M</expbody>
        <expresult> = 0.595</expresult>
      </dynexp>
    </paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="5" textcolor="#43505C">minimum transverse steel at M</paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="1" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="True">
      <dynexp formula="DC_tamax = Max(DC_ta_1, DC_ta_2, DC_ta_3, DC_ta_4, DC_ta_5, DC_ta_6, DC_ta_7, DC_ta_8, DC_ta_9, DC_ta_10, DC_ta_11)" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="True" showsteps="False">
        <expbody>DC_tamax = Max(DC_ta_1, DC_ta_2, DC_ta_3, DC_ta_4, DC_ta_5, DC_ta_6, DC_ta_7, DC_ta_8, DC_ta_9, DC_ta_10, DC_ta_11)</expbody>
        <expresult> = 0.575</expresult>
      </dynexp>
    </paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="5" textcolor="#43505C">face steel area, largest</paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="1" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="True">
      <dynexp formula="DC_tsmax = Max(DC_ts_1, DC_ts_2, DC_ts_3, DC_ts_4, DC_ts_5, DC_ts_6, DC_ts_7, DC_ts_8, DC_ts_9, DC_ts_10, DC_ts_11)" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="True" showsteps="False">
        <expbody>DC_tsmax = Max(DC_ts_1, DC_ts_2, DC_ts_3, DC_ts_4, DC_ts_5, DC_ts_6, DC_ts_7, DC_ts_8, DC_ts_9, DC_ts_10, DC_ts_11)</expbody>
        <expresult> = 0.919</expresult>
      </dynexp>
    </paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="5" textcolor="#43505C">face bar spacing, largest</paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="1" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="True">
      <dynexp formula="DC_sect = Max(DC_flex_N, DC_flex_P, DC_flex_B, DC_min_N, DC_min_P, DC_min_B, DC_eps_N, DC_eps_P, DC_eps_B, DC_I_N, DC_I_P, DC_I_B, DC_shear, DC_LN, DC_LP, DC_LB)" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="True" showsteps="False">
        <expbody>DC_sect = Max(DC_flex_N, DC_flex_P, DC_flex_B, DC_min_N, DC_min_P, DC_min_B, DC_eps_N, DC_eps_P, DC_eps_B, DC_I_N, DC_I_P, DC_I_B, DC_shear, DC_LN, DC_LP, DC_LB)</expbody>
        <expresult> = 0.955</expresult>
      </dynexp>
    </paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="5" textcolor="#43505C">flexure, Service I, shear, tension</paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="1" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="True">
      <dynexp formula="DC_det = Max(DC_minAv, DC_sp, DC_tamax, DC_tsmax, DC_hk)" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="True" showsteps="False">
        <expbody>DC_det = Max(DC_minAv, DC_sp, DC_tamax, DC_tsmax, DC_hk)</expbody>
        <expresult> = 0.985</expresult>
      </dynexp>
    </paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="5" textcolor="#43505C">transverse steel and spacing, faces, hook</paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="1" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="True">
      <dynexp formula="DC_dist = Max(DC_sect, DC_det)" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="True" showsteps="False">
        <expbody>DC_dist = Max(DC_sect, DC_det)</expbody>
        <expresult> = 0.985</expresult>
      </dynexp>
    </paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="5" textcolor="#43505C">largest of the check ratios</paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="1" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="True">
      <dynexp formula="Status = If(DC_dist &lt;= 1, &quot;✓ All Checks Pass&quot;, &quot;⊗ There are FAILURES&quot;)" mathlayout="on" showformula="False" showresult="True" showsteps="False" style="Result only" showidentifier="False">
        <expbody>Status = If(DC_dist &lt;= 1, "✓ All Checks Pass", "⊗ There are FAILURES")</expbody>
        <expresult>✓ All Checks Pass</expresult>
      </dynexp>
    </paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="5" textcolor="#43505C">numerical checks of this calculation</paragraph>
    <section name="Checks" capture="False" hide="true">
      <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="1" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="True">
        <dynexp formula="Chk_flex_N = If(DC_flex_N &lt;= 1, &quot;✓ PASS&quot;, &quot;⊗ FAIL&quot;)" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="True" showsteps="False">
          <expbody>Chk_flex_N = If(DC_flex_N &lt;= 1, "✓ PASS", "⊗ FAIL")</expbody>
          <expresult> = ✓ PASS</expresult>
        </dynexp>
      </paragraph>
      <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="1" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="True">
        <dynexp formula="Chk_flex_P = If(DC_flex_P &lt;= 1, &quot;✓ PASS&quot;, &quot;⊗ FAIL&quot;)" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="True" showsteps="False">
          <expbody>Chk_flex_P = If(DC_flex_P &lt;= 1, "✓ PASS", "⊗ FAIL")</expbody>
          <expresult> = ✓ PASS</expresult>
        </dynexp>
      </paragraph>
      <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="1" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="True">
        <dynexp formula="Chk_flex_B = If(DC_flex_B &lt;= 1, &quot;✓ PASS&quot;, &quot;⊗ FAIL&quot;)" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="True" showsteps="False">
          <expbody>Chk_flex_B = If(DC_flex_B &lt;= 1, "✓ PASS", "⊗ FAIL")</expbody>
          <expresult> = ✓ PASS</expresult>
        </dynexp>
      </paragraph>
      <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="1" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="True">
        <dynexp formula="Chk_min_N = If(DC_min_N &lt;= 1, &quot;✓ PASS&quot;, &quot;⊗ FAIL&quot;)" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="True" showsteps="False">
          <expbody>Chk_min_N = If(DC_min_N &lt;= 1, "✓ PASS", "⊗ FAIL")</expbody>
          <expresult> = ✓ PASS</expresult>
        </dynexp>
      </paragraph>
      <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="1" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="True">
        <dynexp formula="Chk_min_P = If(DC_min_P &lt;= 1, &quot;✓ PASS&quot;, &quot;⊗ FAIL&quot;)" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="True" showsteps="False">
          <expbody>Chk_min_P = If(DC_min_P &lt;= 1, "✓ PASS", "⊗ FAIL")</expbody>
          <expresult> = ✓ PASS</expresult>
        </dynexp>
      </paragraph>
      <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="1" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="True">
        <dynexp formula="Chk_min_B = If(DC_min_B &lt;= 1, &quot;✓ PASS&quot;, &quot;⊗ FAIL&quot;)" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="True" showsteps="False">
          <expbody>Chk_min_B = If(DC_min_B &lt;= 1, "✓ PASS", "⊗ FAIL")</expbody>
          <expresult> = ✓ PASS</expresult>
        </dynexp>
      </paragraph>
      <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="1" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="True">
        <dynexp formula="Chk_eps_N = If(DC_eps_N &lt;= 1, &quot;✓ PASS&quot;, &quot;⊗ FAIL&quot;)" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="True" showsteps="False">
          <expbody>Chk_eps_N = If(DC_eps_N &lt;= 1, "✓ PASS", "⊗ FAIL")</expbody>
          <expresult> = ✓ PASS</expresult>
        </dynexp>
      </paragraph>
      <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="1" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="True">
        <dynexp formula="Chk_eps_P = If(DC_eps_P &lt;= 1, &quot;✓ PASS&quot;, &quot;⊗ FAIL&quot;)" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="True" showsteps="False">
          <expbody>Chk_eps_P = If(DC_eps_P &lt;= 1, "✓ PASS", "⊗ FAIL")</expbody>
          <expresult> = ✓ PASS</expresult>
        </dynexp>
      </paragraph>
      <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="1" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="True">
        <dynexp formula="Chk_eps_B = If(DC_eps_B &lt;= 1, &quot;✓ PASS&quot;, &quot;⊗ FAIL&quot;)" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="True" showsteps="False">
          <expbody>Chk_eps_B = If(DC_eps_B &lt;= 1, "✓ PASS", "⊗ FAIL")</expbody>
          <expresult> = ✓ PASS</expresult>
        </dynexp>
      </paragraph>
      <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="1" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="True">
